   "source": [
    "## 8 · Candidate pools from the prospective gold standard\n",
    "\n",
    "Each query is one disease whose true (post-cutoff) drug is hidden in a pool of\n",
    "distractor drugs drawn from the rest of the gold set. Diseases are sampled\n",
    "round-robin across therapeutic areas so the sample is not dominated by oncology,\n",
    "and each drug is the positive for at most one query."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "cell16",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "22 queries  (pool=8):\n",
      "  - [Cardiovascular] cardiovascular disease (DOID:1287)  true drug: semaglutide\n",
      "  - [Dermatology] vitiligo (DOID:12306)  true drug: ruxolitinib\n",
      "  - [Immunology] polymyalgia rheumatica (DOID:853)  true drug: tocilizumab\n",
      "  - [Oncology] multiple myeloma (DOID:9538)  true drug: teclistamab\n",
