      "  - [Oncology] diffuse large B-cell lymphoma (DOID:0050745)  true drug: glofitamab\n",
      "  - [Immunology] Crohn disease (DOID:8778)  true drug: risankizumab\n",
      "  - [Oncology] acute myeloid leukemia (DOID:9119)  true drug: venetoclax\n",
      "  - [Oncology] biliary tract cancer (DOID:4607)  true drug: durvalumab\n",
