   "source": [
    "## 8½ · Single-call trial (run this before the full sweep)\n",
    "\n",
    "One query, one model, **one OpenAI call**. Prints the exact prompt and the raw\n",
    "response so you can eyeball the anonymized dossier, the JSON, and the parse\n",
    "before paying for the whole grid. Requires `MODE='real'` and `OPENAI_API_KEY`\n",
    "in the environment. Costs about ¢ 0.1.\n"
   ]
  },
