      "F. Drug-7\n",
      "   Drug profile (from the knowledge graph): Drug-7 targets AMY1C; Drug-7 targets GLP1R; Drug-7 targets DPP4; Drug-7 targets MME; Drug-7 targets LPL; Drug-7 targets ALB\n",
      "G. Drug-6\n",
      "   Drug profile (from the knowledge graph): Drug-6 targets SLC47A2; Drug-6 targets SLCO1B3; Drug-6 targets SLC22A2; Drug-6 targets SLC22A8; Drug-6 targets SLC22A6; Drug-6 targets JAK3; Drug-6 targets JAK1; Drug-6 targets ABCG2\n",
      "H. Drug-8\n",
      "   Drug profile (from the knowledge graph): Drug-8 targets SLC47A2; Drug-8 targets SLCO1B3; Drug-8 targets FCGR1A; Drug-8 targets SLCO1B1; Drug-8 targets GAA; Drug-8 targets CTSB; Drug-8 targets CTSL; Drug-8 targets ABCC1\n",
