   "source": [
    "## 8¾ · Cap sweep — how much evidence before it overwhelms?\n",
    "\n",
    "Sweeps `CAP` (neighbours kept per predicate) and reports, per setting, **MRR**\n",
    "(does the signal improve?), **parse_rate** (do big prompts ever break the JSON?),\n",
    "and **approx prompt tokens** (cost / bloat). Runs the `kg` arm over all queries ×\n",
    "a couple of shuffles with the trial model. The KG is loaded once and reused\n",
    "across caps. Pick the knee: where MRR plateaus, stop adding evidence.\n"
   ]
  },
